Task 3: Prepare the system by testing the connection and checking for sudo availability. If the connection test fails or sudo is not available, gather bootstrap facts and install necessary bootstrap packages using raw commands based on the OS family. Ensure libdnf5 is installed on RedHat-based systems.  
